diff --git a/CHANGELOG.rst b/CHANGELOG.rst
index e166f03..10c3efd 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.rst
+++ b/CHANGELOG.rst
@@ -1,3 +1,12 @@
+Unreleased
+==========
+
+- Rename the ``time`` parameter of ``TTLCache.expire()`` and
+  ``TLRUCache.expire()`` to ``now``, so it no longer shadows the
+  ``time`` module.  Passing ``time`` as a keyword argument still
+  works, but is deprecated and will be removed in a future release.
+
+
 v7.2.8 (2026-10-31)
 ===================
 
